<title>USA: Hughes gets $64.7 mln US defense contract.</title>
<headline>Hughes gets $64.7 mln US defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hughes Missile Systems Co, a division of General Motors Corp, has received a modified $64.7 million U.S. defense contract for 121 sea-launched Tomahawk cruise missiles, the Navy said.</p>
</text>
